<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crŏcĕus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to saffron,
			saffron-</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 109</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tinctus,</span>”
				<i>saffron-sauce</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 48, 68, § 134</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 10, 59, § 83</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>saffron-colored,
				yellow, golden</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lutum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 4, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cubile,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					1, 447</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acanthus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					1, 649</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chlamys,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 775</span></i>
			 al.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 1, 530</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">honor,</span>”
				<i>a saffron-tint</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					8, 444</span></i>
			.</div>
